{
    "title": "Carnival HUB",
    "description": "As you prepare for your vacation, download the ultimate cruise app! Available on all Carnival ships.\r\n\r\nUse the Carnival HUB app to share your cruise countdown with friends, then explore and book shore excursions, spa treatments, drink packages and more (restricted for adults). When the time comes, you may also check-in and obtain your boarding documents.\r\n\r\nAs you board your ship, connect to Carnival\u2019s Wi-Fi to view what\u2019s happening, weather, dining menus and more! Onboard internet purchase is NOT required to use the Carnival HUB app.\r\n\r\nBefore your cruise:\r\n\u2022   Load up on excursions, drink packages, spa treatments and more (restricted for adults)\r\n\u2022   Check-in and prepare your boarding documents\r\n\u2022   Share your cruise countdown with friends and family\r\n(At this time, guests on Australian sailings may share their countdown and use features once on board their ship.)\r\n\r\nOnce on board:\r\n\u2022   Chat to connect with family and friends on board. (Low, flat activation fee applies.)\r\n\u2022   Day-by-day schedule of hundreds of onboard events\r\n\u2022   Choose your favorite events and get reminders\r\n\u2022   Open times and menus of food and dining venues\r\n\u2022   Searchable deck plans with key areas highlighted\r\n\u2022   Itinerary details, including current ship time, arrival/departure times for upcoming ports of call  \r\n\u2022   Real-time information on guests\u2019 current Sail & Sign shipboard account balance\r\n\u2022   Weather for each day of your sailing\r\n\u2022   Find information like dining attire easily\r\n\u2022   Ability to view and purchase shore excursions (restricted for adults)\r\n\u2022   Order pizza for delivery almost anywhere on board (On select ships. Fees apply.)\r\n\r\nGo ahead. Download it now. Your vacation deserves it.",
    "descriptionHTML": "As you prepare for your vacation, download the ultimate cruise app! Available on all Carnival ships.<br><br>Use the Carnival HUB app to share your cruise countdown with friends, then explore and book shore excursions, spa treatments, drink packages and more (restricted for adults). When the time comes, you may also check-in and obtain your boarding documents.<br><br>As you board your ship, connect to Carnival\u2019s Wi-Fi to view what\u2019s happening, weather, dining menus and more! Onboard internet purchase is NOT required to use the Carnival HUB app.<br><br>Before your cruise:<br>\u2022   Load up on excursions, drink packages, spa treatments and more (restricted for adults)<br>\u2022   Check-in and prepare your boarding documents<br>\u2022   Share your cruise countdown with friends and family<br>(At this time, guests on Australian sailings may share their countdown and use features once on board their ship.)<br><br>Once on board:<br>\u2022   Chat to connect with family and friends on board. (Low, flat activation fee applies.)<br>\u2022   Day-by-day schedule of hundreds of onboard events<br>\u2022   Choose your favorite events and get reminders<br>\u2022   Open times and menus of food and dining venues<br>\u2022   Searchable deck plans with key areas highlighted<br>\u2022   Itinerary details, including current ship time, arrival/departure times for upcoming ports of call  <br>\u2022   Real-time information on guests\u2019 current Sail &amp; Sign shipboard account balance<br>\u2022   Weather for each day of your sailing<br>\u2022   Find information like dining attire easily<br>\u2022   Ability to view and purchase shore excursions (restricted for adults)<br>\u2022   Order pizza for delivery almost anywhere on board (On select ships. Fees apply.)<br><br>Go ahead. Download it now. Your vacation deserves it.",
